  "title": "Chef John's Shrimp and Grits",
  "description": "This shrimp and grits recipe cooks plump shrimp in a creamy Cajun sauce with bacon; serve on cheesy grits for a Southern classic that's great anytime!",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2014-02-28T15:49:44-05:00",
